WEBVTT

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.410
<i>This is brutal... but fun!</i>

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:23.000
<i>How far can I get if I just keep running?</i>

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.630
<i>What will I find there?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.380
<i>I want to try it and see!</i>

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.820
<i>I'm gonna do it!</i>

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.320
Such long crosswalks. Such tall buildings!

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.820
So many stores! So many people!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:59.310
Tokyo's amazin'!

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:07.290
Maybe I'll get to do city girl stuff, 
like eat crêpes after school.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.290
Crêpe!

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:08.260
I can't wait!

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.870
Are you listening to me?!

00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.300
Pardon?!

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.970
The next few years are crucial for you!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:18.310
Do you get that?!

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.130
I need an explanation for this.

00:01:20.130 --> 00:01:22.090
What'd he do wrong?

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:25.410
<i>He looks about my age.</i>

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Wow, he sure doesn't seem sorry.</i>

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:37.320
<i>Maybe Tokyo's a little scary after all.</i>

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:41.490
I got this. Ya didn't have to call me.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.500
<i>Listen, ya can't afford to be 
late for the entrance ceremony!</i>

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.430
<i>Hey, Sis! Didja see any celebrities yet?</i>

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:50.900
<i>I want autographs!</i>

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.500
<i>I want pics!</i>

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:54.000
Sure, if I meet one.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:01.590
<i>Hiyori! Your dad is always thinkin' 
about ya, no matter where ya are, okay?!</i>

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:03.350
Yep, I know.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:06.730
<i>That's enough, Dad. We gotta end the call.</i>

00:02:07.820 --> 00:02:10.950
<i>Okay, guys. Ready, set...</i>

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.900
<i>Have a good day!</i>

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.690
Here I go!

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:37.630
<b>Heroines Run the Show</b>

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.680
<b>S
